OL,3,GNEWSAHomes evacuated as 'suspicious
OL,4,Adevices' found
OL,5,
OL,6,FA number of homes have been evacuated
OL,7,Fafter police found "a number of
OL,8,Fsuspicious devices" during a search
OL,9,Foperation in west Belfast on Friday
OL,10,Fmorning.
OL,12,FA 35-year-old man who was arrested on
OL,13,Fsuspicion of offences under the
OL,14,FTerrorism Act, remains in police
OL,15,Fcustody.
OL,17,FOfficers are at a house in Edwina
OL,18,FStreet, off the Shankill Road,
OL,19,Faccompanied by Army Ammunition
OL,20,FTechnical Officers (ATO).
OL,23,APub: 30-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,417,410,260,120,0,100
